WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:05.071
♪♪

00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:06.072 line:0%
What was that?

00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:07.507 line:0%
I swear to God.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.075 line:0%
Oh, dude, the [bleep]
bunny is out, too!

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:10.610 line:0%
- I wanna hit the door.
- Is that what that is?

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:12.011 line:0%
No, it's a bulldog.

00:00:12.044 --> 00:00:14.380 line:0%
- It's a kangaroo.
- How--how many were there?

00:00:14.413 --> 00:00:15.481 line:0%
- Three.
- There were--

00:00:15.514 --> 00:00:16.816 line:0%
No, there was a
drummer, too.

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:18.217 line:0%
- Oh, [bleep], you're right,
the chicken.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.987 line:0%
Chicken, a kangaroo,
a rabbit.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.522 line:0%
Wait, wait, we need to know
where he is.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:23.656 line:0%
There he is,
there he is!

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:24.924 line:0%
- Oh, he's over there.
- Okay.

00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:26.993 line:0%
Wait, where are the other ones?
We should check one.

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:28.027 line:0%
Are they all out?

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:28.995 line:0%
Oh, they're all out.

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:30.530 line:0%
- [laughing]
- Ah, Jesus!

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:32.799 line:0%
- Oh, I'm so on edge!
- [laughter]

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:39.239
♪♪

